00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.570
at basically taking shots at those others

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.120
saying, "Don't rely on celebrities

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.270
to make your investing decisions for you.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:03.800
Go do your own research.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.650
Go educate yourself first,

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.640
and then if you decide
you wanna buy crypto,

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.000
well, come to us.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.950
And ironically, they are
going to be using celebrities

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.423
to deliver that message.

00:03:14.423 --> 00:03:17.310
- BINANCE and I are here
to tell you trust yourself,

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:19.110
and of course, do your own research.

00:03:19.992 --> 00:03:22.230
- [Narrator] Even companies
that are not directly related

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.420
